      "id": "gv-787650-b00001",
      "text": "Singer Pasha Perfeni, who represented Moldova at the international Eurovision Song Contest 2023, took 18th place in the Grand Final. The curious fact of this year's Eurovision is that the current winner, Swedish musician Loreen, won Eurovision 2012, in which Pasha Parfeni also participated. At that time, Loreen presented the song Euphoria. This year her winning song was called “Tattoo.”",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "body_start": 0,
      "body_end": 389,
      "source_links": [
        "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pasha_Parfeni",
        "https://eurovisionworld.com/esc/loreen-from-sweden-wins-eurovision-song-contest-2023",
        "https://eurovisionworld.com/eurovision/2012"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-787650-b00002",
      "text": "According to Wikipedia, Loreen is the first woman, and the second performer to have won the competition twice.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "body_start": 391,
      "body_end": 501,
      "source_links": [
        "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Loreen_(singer)"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-787650-b00003",
      "text": "In 2012, Moldova, with Pasha's song “Lăutar”, took the 11th place in the finale, with 81 votes.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "body_start": 503,
      "body_end": 598,
      "source_links": [
        "https://eurovisionworld.com/eurovision/2012"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-787650-b00004",
      "text": "The musician's performance in 2023 was rated at 96 points and took the 18th place. He performed the composition “Soarele și Luna.”",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "body_start": 600,
      "body_end": 730,
      "source_links": [
        "https://eurovisionworld.com/eurovision/2023"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-787650-b00005",
      "text": "As reported by the NewsMaker, of the total 96 votes, 76 were the votes of the audience, and 20 were points from the national juries of different countries.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "body_start": 732,
      "body_end": 887,
      "source_links": [
        "https://eurovisionworld.com/eurovision/2023#moldova",
        "https://newsmaker.md/rus/novosti/kto-i-kak-golosoval-za-moldovu-v-finale-evrovideniya-2023/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-787650-b00006",
      "text": "This is how the votes break down:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 6,
      "body_start": 889,
      "body_end": 922,
      "source_links": [
        "https://newsmaker.md/rus/novosti/kto-i-kak-golosoval-za-moldovu-v-finale-evrovideniya-2023/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
