      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-787650-b00043",
      "text": "Newsmaker highlights that Moldova has been participating in the Eurovision Song Contest since 2005. So far, the best result was shown by the SunStroke Project in 2017 with the song “Hey, Mamma!” which took 3rd place:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 43,
      "body_start": 1659,
      "body_end": 1875,
      "source_links": [
        "https://newsmaker.md/rus/novosti/kto-i-kak-golosoval-za-moldovu-v-finale-evrovideniya-2023/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-787650-b00044",
      "text": "Last year, the group Zdob și Zdub and the Brothers Advachovs took 7th place in the final of the competition with the song Trenulețul:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 44,
      "body_start": 1877,
      "body_end": 2010,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-787650-b00045",
      "text": "Moldova's Pasha Parfeni posted on his Facebook page words of gratitude on the night of the final:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 45,
      "body_start": 2012,
      "body_end": 2109,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.facebook.com/PashaParfeny/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-787650-b00046",
      "text": "> Mulțumesc pentru toată susținerea voastră! Noi ne-am dăruit la maxim pentru Moldova! Mulțumesc sponsorilor noștri și fiecărui/ fiecărei moldovean/ moldovence pentru suportul pe care ni l-ați oferit!]",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 46,
      "body_start": 2111,
      "body_end": 2312,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-787650-b00047",
      "text": "> Thanks for all your support! We gave our best for Moldova! Thank you to our sponsors and to each and every Moldovan for the support you have given us!",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 47,
      "body_start": 2314,
      "body_end": 2466,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    }
  ],
